cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenT1D, cite this repository and identify the exact commit or
  release. Also cite the upstream models, methods and datasets used.
type: software
title: 'OpenT1D: an open, modular virtual laboratory for type 1 diabetes research'
authors:
  - given-names: Matthias
    family-names: van der Galiën
repository-code: 'https://github.com/OpenT1D/lab'
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  OpenT1D provides development-stage computational research workflows for
  synthetic simulation, forecasting, secretion and meal-test analysis, with
  explicit provenance, failure accounting and reconstructible reports.
  Bounded workflows are internally verified; independent researcher
  acceptance, human-data evaluation and biological validity remain open.
  No versioned software release has been published.
keywords:
  - type 1 diabetes
  - computational modeling
  - reproducible research
  - simulation
  - digital twin
